   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "30,000 QPS / 16 shards  ~=  1,875 QPS per shard",
   "originalText": "30,000 QPS / 16 shards  ~=  1,875 QPS per shard",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "sh",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "shn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 2566,
   "width": 532,
   "height": 120,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100154,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 701078,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every query filters on hotel_id, so the shard is computable from the\nrequest: single-shard reads and writes, always. And critically, NO\nTRANSACTION EVER SPANS TWO HOTELS - a booking touches exactly one\nhotel's inventory - so there are no distributed transactions at all.\n\nThe cost: a query spanning many hotels (a city search results page)\nbecomes a scatter-gather. Acceptable, because hotel SEARCH is served by\na separate search index, not by scanning the inventory table.",
   "originalText": "Every query filters on hotel_id, so the shard is computable from the\nrequest: single-shard reads and writes, always. And critically, NO\nTRANSACTION EVER SPANS TWO HOTELS - a booking touches exactly one\nhotel's inventory - so there are no distributed transactions at all.\n\nThe cost: a query spanning many hotels (a city search results page)\nbecomes a scatter-gather. Acceptable, because hotel SEARCH is served by\na separate search index, not by scanning the inventory table.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
